 border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: white;\">Areas of Interest</span></span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p style=\"margin-left: 12pt; text-align: left;\">3D Printing, Composite materials.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Publications Details</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Anoosha N M, et all, “Tensile test &amp; FEM Analysis of ABS material using FDM Technique”, IJIRST, Volume 07, Issue 06, June 2018.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid bla